Display the file recently browsed, move the Navigation keys to select a book press “M”  button to enter, it will go to the last page you read on the selected book.

<PIC:Manual13_4>
{{image description: eBook file list screen with entries such as 01, 02.txt, A Connecticut Yankee in King Ar, A Journey to the Centre of the Ea, A Little Princess.epub, A Modest Proposal.epub, Aesops Fables.epub, Aladdin and the Magic Lamp.epu, and Alexandridis, Christos.epub.}}

Adjusting the volume:   Press the "Up/Down" key at the Navigation or Up/Prev  page, Down/Next page key to adjust the volume.  Play/Pause:   Press the "Play / Pause" key to pause or continue play.  Forward / Backward/Previous/Next:   Press and hold “left direction” key to  backward the music and “right direction” key to forward the music. Press and release “left  direction” key to go to previous audio file and “right direction” key to go to next audio file.  Music play mode:   There are five audio playing mode: "Repeat Mode", "Play  Mode"," MS EQ", "EQ Sel" and "User EQ setup". When in Music mode, press “M” then  select desire mode that you wish to made adjustment.  

<PIC:Manual13_8>
{{image description: Music playback screen with a settings menu open. The track list includes Better Than Today, Kylie Minogue, and Aphrodite; menu items include Repeat Mode, Play Mode, MSEQ, EQ Sel, and User EQ Setup.}}

Go to “Video” and press “M” key to enter the Video mode. This device AVI, RMVB and  MPEG2 video format.

<PIC:Manual13_9>
{{image description: Video playback screen showing a colorful parrot video, a pause icon, progress bar, filename VIDEO1.rmvb, elapsed time 00:00:30, total 00:01:09, and volume 20.}}

